OL,3,GNEWSAA sea of red and white to welcome
OL,4,Ahome FAI Cup heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sea of red and white is expected to
OL,7,Fflood Londonderry's Guildhall Square on
OL,8,FMonday as Derry City fans welcome their
OL,9,Fteam home after their FAI Cup triumph.
OL,11,FThe Candystripes secured their seventh
OL,12,FFAI Cup win with a 1-0 victory over
OL,13,FWaterford at the Aviva Stadium in
OL,14,FDublin on Sunday.
OL,16,FMayor Grace Ui Niallais said thousands
OL,17,Fof buoyant City fans are expected in
OL,18,Fthe city centre for the homecoming.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
