OL,3,GNEWSAA sea of red and white to welcome
OL,4,Ahome FAI Cup heroes
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The whole city's been behind the team
OL,7,Fthe whole way," she said. "To be able
OL,8,Fto bring the cup back and to be able to
OL,9,Fcelebrate together as a city is just
OL,10,Famazing."
